▶ September 12 flight audit replay
  ✔ UA1532: preserves departure facts when no position is available (8284.817152ms)
  ✔ AA3008: preserves departure facts when no position is available (57.843446ms)
  ✔ keeps pushback registered when a moving aircraft pauses near its stand (261.084593ms)
  ✔ does not invent ORD to LAX when the route feeds have no flight (6.483971ms)
  ✔ does not use an old flight-number route when the current schedule feed is unavailable (4.943069ms)
  ✔ WN2512: ignores a different airborne tail and future actual push/takeoff (31.547072ms)
  ✔ UA218: a canonical inbound history redirect does not put airborne UA219 at the gate (45.632459ms)
✔ September 12 flight audit replay (8693.291961ms)
▶ MDW departure surface-stage replays
  ✔ WN363: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (57.247512ms)
  ✔ WN1035: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (51.726407ms)
  ✔ WN102: fresh surface telemetry contradicts a premature provider takeoff (48.997071ms)
✔ MDW departure surface-stage replays (158.514934ms)
▶ ground trace freshness
  ✔ accepts recent movement but rejects stale and future movement (1.575131ms)
✔ ground trace freshness (1.777006ms)
▶ AA2554 inbound/main-stage consistency
  ✔ does not alternate Gate and Inbound as surface positions appear and disappear (0.412556ms)
✔ AA2554 inbound/main-stage consistency (0.608713ms)
▶ inbound canonical history details
  ✔ reads actual gate arrival from the redirected dated flight (5.252113ms)
✔ inbound canonical history details (5.467426ms)
▶ taxi duration consistency
  ✔ uses current push and takeoff estimates instead of a generic 25 minutes (0.363582ms)
✔ taxi duration consistency (0.47083ms)
▶ first-class pushback and taxi-out stages
  ✔ keeps a parked 0 kt aircraft At gate (0.255029ms)
  ✔ shows first 2–5 kt movement as Pushback (0.124561ms)
  ✔ shows sustained 8–20 kt movement as Taxiing out (0.083288ms)
  ✔ does not return to At gate through a stale surface gap (0.085516ms)
  ✔ keeps Taxiing out monotonic once its latch is established (0.151945ms)
  ✔ preserves the existing takeoff transition (0.154002ms)
  ✔ renders Pushback and Taxiing out as separate passenger stages (12.59238ms)
✔ first-class pushback and taxi-out stages (13.780974ms)
▶ on the move evidence
  ✔ UA219: keeps an overdue estimate non-actual, then records only observed/provider push (275.533964ms)
  ✔ UA219: reconstructs the first stand exit from track history instead of the 10:03 taxi classification (0.623707ms)
  ✔ UA219: replaces a persisted detected time copied from the 9:25 estimate (0.157598ms)
  ✔ preserves a genuine earlier movement latch when it did not copy an estimate (0.241344ms)
  ✔ labels the passenger operational event Pushback, not Departure (4.397191ms)
  ✔ UA3600: never regresses from Taxiing out to Pushback during normal surface changes (208.902154ms)
  ✔ does not advance a stationary aircraft just because scheduled departure passed (38.704043ms)
✔ on the move evidence (529.281837ms)
✔ preserves missing weather feeds as unknown while the flight still loads (46.383055ms)
▶ MDW fresh ground position can advance the stage
  ✔ recognizes WN1266 runway-area fix as already away from the passenger gates (0.301482ms)
  ✔ does not call a terminal-side stationary fix away from the gate area (0.431819ms)
  ✔ does not infer movement from a remote position hours before the departure window (0.305232ms)
✔ MDW fresh ground position can advance the stage (1.220727ms)
▶ stage and ground-map position identity
  ✔ uses the commercial flight number for the stage FR24 lookup (3.401533ms)
✔ stage and ground-map position identity (3.526348ms)
▶ public schedule fallback
  ✔ shares each section date across Scheduled, Estimated and Actual labels (4.897347ms)
  ✔ honors explicit later dates across midnight and month rollover (0.865965ms)
  ✔ keeps labels without a preceding section date unconfirmed (0.359938ms)
  ✔ still rejects invalid clocks and unknown timezone abbreviations (0.352231ms)
  ⚠ loads an exact route from a FlightStats-style public status page (2.042587ms) # Held #6: unknown-airport route support — https://github.com/jarndtphoto/Inbound/blob/codex/test-suite-cleanup/docs/test-cleanup-held-bugs.md#6-zrh--unknown-airport-public-route-support
  ✔ parses public scheduled and actual gate times when FlightStats exposes them (0.453537ms)
  ✔ chooses the active return leg instead of the earlier same-number segment (0.949064ms)
  ✔ prefers a recently arrived local-date flight over tomorrow UTC-date schedule (0.521933ms)
  ✔ fails closed when the page does not identify two known airports (0.165002ms)
  ✔ allows an exact FR24 leg up to 60 seconds old to establish origin-gate identity (1.444792ms)
