✔ current-flight trace selection (1.575484ms)
▶ live reroute display geometry
  ✔ uses the actual deviation for the portion behind the aircraft (0.25416ms)
  ✔ joins actual track naturally to the current aircraft without an obsolete filed-route jump (0.1188ms)
  ✔ starts projection at the current aircraft and never selects a segment behind it (0.223026ms)
  ✔ keeps Route and Weather on the same canonical story samples (17.292798ms)
