  ✔ never renders interpolated route samples as waypoint markers (5.306669ms)
  ✔ does not add published fix markers as the map zoom changes (0.885739ms)
  ✔ does not evaluate future weather against the abandoned route behind the aircraft (0.880817ms)
✔ live reroute display geometry (26.076573ms)
