  ✔ renders filed fixes as zoom-stable white markers without sample markers (25.640539ms)
✔ FlightAware filed route references (28.886022ms)
▶ AAL3197 weather entry rendering
  ✔ orders samples in direction of travel and discards points behind progress (0.85928ms)
  ✔ renders the numbered marker at the affected-range entry coordinate (47.714244ms)
  ✔ leads with the next weather event once and keeps its entry timing and shared map wording (10.853887ms)
  ✔ does not split one continuous moderate range when storm detail changes (0.310892ms)
  ✔ combines contiguous light and moderate turbulence into one passenger event (0.425212ms)
✔ AAL3197 weather entry rendering (60.659318ms)
